 ```
 
+## Symbolic links
+
+Symbolic links stored in an archive are skipped unless `-l/--links` is
+in use. With `-l/--links` each symlink is shown under its name with a
+`.rclonelink` suffix, and reading it returns the link target. This
+means copying with `-l/--links` recreates the symlinks on a
+destination which supports them.
+
+```
+$ rclone lsl --links :archive:s3:rclone/dir/100files.zip
+        5 2026-09-28 14:16:59.000000000 src/file.txt
+        8 2026-09-28 14:16:59.000000000 src/link.txt.rclonelink
+```
+
+A regular file whose name ends in `.rclonelink` is still treated as a
+regular file.
 
